        <div class="rt-enter"><img width="1" height="23" loading="lazy" src="{{ 'tk-ft-r-enter.svg' | asset_url }}" alt=""></div>
        <div class="rt-routes"><img width="294" height="57" loading="lazy" src="{{ 'tk-ft-r-routes.svg' | asset_url }}" alt=""></div>
        <div class="rt-task ft-a"><p class="rt-k">YOUR TASK</p><p class="rt-q">Help me refine this launch plan.</p></div>
        <div class="rt-dec ft-a"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#f2f2f2" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="6" y1="3" x2="6" y2="15"/><circle cx="18" cy="6" r="3"/><circle cx="6" cy="18" r="3"/><path d="M18 9a9 9 0 0 1-9 9"/></svg><div><b>Router</b><span>Matches task to model</span></div></div>
        <div class="rt-opt rt-loc ft-a"><div class="rt-id"><svg width="11.63" height="11.63" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#4ABE18" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="4" y="11" width="16" height="10" rx="2"/><path d="M8 11V7a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v4"/></svg><b>Local AI</b></div><p class="rt-d">For private &amp; everyday work.</p><div class="rt-box"><span>RUNS ON</span><b>Your Mac</b></div><p class="rt-s">Prompts and files processed here.</p></div>
        <i class="rt-pk"></i><div class="rt-opt rt-cld ft-a"><div class="rt-id"><img loading="lazy" src="{{ 'tk-ft-r-cloud.svg' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="11.627" height="11.627"><b>Cloud AI</b></div><p class="rt-d">For more demanding tasks.</p><div class="rt-box"><span>CONTEXT TO SHARE</span><b>Selected summary</b></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="ft-cap" style="top:456px"><span class="f-ic ic-rt"><i></i><i></i></span><b>Router</b><p>Each task goes to the right model: on your Mac, or the cloud if you allow it.</p></div>
    </div>
    <!-- 02 Private Chat -->
    <div class="ft-sc" data-i="1">
      <div class="ft-gl1"><img width="1262" height="978" loading="lazy" src="{{ 'tk-ft-glow-a.svg' | asset_url }}" alt=""></div><div class="ft-gl2"><img width="1379" height="750" loading="lazy" src="{{ 'tk-ft-glow-b1.svg' | asset_url }}" alt=""></div><div class="ft-grid"></div>
      <div class="pcw" style="left:193px;top:109px">
        <div class="pc-in ft-a"><div class="pc-ta"><span class="pc-tx"></span></div>
